refactor: redesign Agent Detail page for better UX

Overview tab:
- Replace sparse 3-col grid with full-width Details card using icon+label
  rows in a responsive grid. Each detail has an icon, label, value, and
  optional badge (provider shown as badge on Model row).
- Move provider badge from header into Details section.
- Extensions card now shows count badge in header.
- Extensions list uses monospace font for canonical IDs.
- System Prompt card sits beside Extensions in a balanced 2-col layout.
- Empty system prompt shows a dashed placeholder instead of nothing.

Sessions tab:
- Remove Status column (not meaningful for desktop).
- Rename "Title" → "Session", "Messages" shows hash icon, "Last Updated"
  → "Last Active".

Header:
- "Send Message" button renamed to "Chat" with solid emerald styling.
